# 🚀 Shopify AI Marketing Intelligence Platform

## 📌 Overview
The Shopify AI Marketing Intelligence Platform is a full-stack SaaS application designed to help e-commerce businesses transform raw Shopify data into actionable insights using AI, Machine Learning, and Data Analytics.

It enables data-driven decision-making by providing advanced analytics beyond standard Shopify dashboards.

---

## 🎯 Objective
To build a scalable analytics platform that integrates with Shopify stores and delivers real-time marketing insights, performance tracking, and AI-powered recommendations.

